  m_Name: BehaviourTree
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Shooter.Game::Shooter.Game.Llm.SystemPromptSpec
  content: Your character is controlled by a behavior tree. The highest priority
    in this tree is assigned to actions triggered automatically when danger arises
    (reflexes). The second level of priority is assigned to actions you can perform
    using your tools (higher-order cognitive functions). Use the look_at_yourself
    tool to check if you currently have an active second-level action.
